    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Let students rate and review courses to build trust and social proof.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p><strong>From your WordPress dashboard</strong><br />\n1. Visit &#8216;Plugin &gt; Add new&#8217;.<br />\n2. Search for &#8216;LearnPress Course Review&#8217;.<br />\n3. Activate LearnPress from your Plugins page.</p>\n<p><strong>From WordPress.org</strong><br />\n1. Search, select and download LearnPress Course Review.<br />\n2. Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress Dashboard.</p>\n",
        "faq": "<p>Check out <a href=\"http://docs.thimpress.com/learnpress\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LearnPress</a> sites.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>4.2.2 (2026-10-16)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: minor bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.2.1 (2026-09-28)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: minor bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.2.0 (2026-01-16)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: security.</li>\n<li>Deprecated file templates: course-sum-rating.php, form-submit-review.php, item-review.php,<br />\nitem-review-wait-approve.php, list-rating-reviews.php, list-reviews.php</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.9 (2025-12-30)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: minor bug.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.8 (2025-05-22)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: conflict with review of WooCommerce.</li>\n<li>Tweak: style.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.7 (2025-05-21)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: error some theme use &#8216;learn_press_course_meta_primary_review&#8217; function deprecated.</li>\n<li>Fixed: load style on Profile.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.6 (2025-05-19)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Refactor code render template.</li>\n<li>Optimize code JS.</li>\n<li>Added: Toast notification when user rated.</li>\n<li>Added: menu Course Review on LearnPress menu, link to comment type &#8216;review&#8217;.</li>\n<li>Exclude course review from WP default comment list.</li>\n<li>Show on Gutenberg theme.</li>\n<li>Show review on list course.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.5 (2025-02-06)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added: option enable/disable review for course.</li>\n<li>Enqueue style on widget filter course, list courses.</li>\n<li>Fixed: number_format rated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.4 (2024-08-29)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Show reviews on single offline course.</li>\n<li>Use CourseModel instead of learn_press_get_course function.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.3 (2024-07-18)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: error stars on review form.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.2 (2024-05-13)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added: feature to filter courses by star review.</li>\n<li>Added: save calculate average rating for course.</li>\n<li>Added: Course sorting by rating.</li>\n<li>Change: icon star review.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.1 (2024-02-01)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: not show list review when has cache.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.1.0 (2023-12-27)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: bug load more when deleted user has comment on system.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.9 (2023-12-26)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: rated stars.</li>\n<li>Tweak: style.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.8 (2023-05-03)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Review per page change from 1 item to 5 item</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.7 (2023-03-24)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: minor bug.</li>\n<li>Updated: translation file po.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.6 (2023-03-15)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Optimize.</li>\n<li>Set cache.</li>\n<li>Load review Ajax via API.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.5 (2023-01-10)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: icon review.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Instead of LP_Request_Handler to LP_Request.</li>\n<li>Compatible with WP 6.1.1.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update review api.</li>\n<li>Fix minor bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix minor bug.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix show icon star on the shortcode.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix compatible LP4.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
